# <Files> sections must apply to .pagespeed. resource URLs too: the module's
# map-to-storage hook runs httpd's file walk against the real resource name.
# This section names one rewritten URL exactly, so it matches neither the
# origin file's leaf (Puzzle.jpg) nor a truncated stand-in leaf: only a
# correct file walk applies it.
<Files "xPuzzle.jpg.pagespeed.ic.fakehash.jpg">
  ModPagespeedDisableFilters convert_jpeg_to_progressive
</Files>
